# Allowlist: ignore everything, then let back in only what the Dockerfile copies.
#
# The opposite style (list what to exclude) fails open: any new file — a local .env, a credential
# dropped in the project root, ascent/ if it were ever renamed — is shipped to the Docker daemon
# on every build until someone remembers to add it here. This way, forgetting fails closed: the
# build breaks loudly instead of silently including something it should not.
*
!package.json
!server.mjs
!api/ingest.js
!lib/ingest-core.mjs
!lib/node-server.mjs
